'''Wall Creeps''' will try to line up with Isaac, and shoot three blood shots quickly in a horizontal line. They walk moderately quickly on the wall they were originally placed onto and they cannot move on another wall. They have a long blood-shot range, but Isaac can attack them safely by shooting diagonally.
{{clear}}

== Variants ==
=== Blind Creep ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Blind Creep
 | id          = 242
 | base hp     = 10
 | environment = {{floor|Cellar}}<br>{{floor|Caves}}{{floor|Catacombs}}{{floor|Flooded Caves}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{room|boss}}
 | behavior    = Randomly crawls along walls and shoots three spread blood shots.
}}

'''Blind Creeps''' will crawl along walls randomly and shoot 3 spreading blood shots, like {{i|The Inner Eye}}. They are slower than Wall Creeps, fire less frequently and do not directly target Isaac, but their shots are less predictable.
{{clear}}

=== The Thing ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a+
 | name        = The Thing
 | image name  = * {{dlc|nr|Afterbirth+}}
 | id          = 304
 | base hp     = 15
 | environment = {{floor|Catacombs}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{dlc|nr}} Chance to replace Wall Creeps, Blind Creeps and Rage Creeps
 | behavior    = Crawls along a wall and attempts to line up with Isaac, then spits a line of damaging Red Creep.
 | unlocked by = The gate is open!
}}

'''The Thing''' will try to line up with Isaac and spit a line of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]]. The creep has a fairly long range, spanning about half of the width of a normal-sized room. During this attack, a tongue will protrude from its mouth which can deal contact damage.

After it uses its Creep attack, it will not be able to do so again until the Creep has faded, although it will still be moving to follow Isaac with its tongue out.
{{clear}}

=== Rage Creep ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Rage Creep
 | id          = 241
 | base hp     = 10
 | environment = {{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Slowly crawls along walls to try to line up with Isaac and shoots a Brimstone laser.
}}

'''Rage Creeps''' will try to line up with Isaac and fire a {{i|Brimstone}} laser. They are much slower than other Creeps and also take more time to charge up their attacks, but they have infinite range and their laser instantly travels across the room, forcing Isaac to be careful when dealing with them, especially when there are many Rage Creeps in the same room.
{{clear}}

=== Soy Creep ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Soy Creep
 | id          = 240
 | variant     = 1
 | base hp     = 13.5
 | environment = {{floor|Mines}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
