'''Soy Creeps''' will try to line up with Isaac and fire a continuous stream of shots that are seemingly affected by {{i|Soy Milk}}. Their range is quite impressive, rendering them able to hit Isaac when he cannot see them. In dark areas, the rooms are illuminated by their eyes.
{{clear}}

