The '''Tainted Soy Creeps''' appear in the Ascent path and will fire continuous streams of tears, similar to the Soy Creep. These streams are shot diagonally in four directions.
{{dlc clear}}{{clear}}

== Notes ==
* Rage Creeps can kill other enemies with their {{i|Brimstone}} laser.
* Unlike other Creeps, The Thing can be a [[Champion]].
** {{dlc|r}} Wall Creeps also have Champion forms.
* {{dlc|r}} If The Thing isn't unlocked yet, it will be replaced by Wall Creeps in Normal mode, or Blind Creeps in [[Hard Mode]].

