== Trivia ==
* The Thing is a reference to the eponymous movie.
** Their sprites prior to ''Repentance'' consist of a red-colored Blind Creep with a stitched mouth and a [[Nerve Ending]] reused as a tongue.
* The Thing is one of five enemies (four without Repentance, three without Afterbirth+) in the game that uses [[Creep]] as projectiles, the others are [[Conjoined Fatty]], [[Fatty#Bloaty|Bloaty]], [[Ultra Pride]] and [[Meatball]].
* [[anti:Soi Creep|Soy Creeps]] are from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Soy Creeps were named Soi Creeps.
** They originally were able to spawn in {{s|Caves}}, {{s|Catacombs}}, {{s|Depths}}, and {{s|Necropolis}}.
* {{dlc|r}} There is an unused version of a Rage Creep known as a Split Rage Creep which shot two {{i|Brimstone}} lasers at diagonal angles instead of one.
** {{dlc|r}} An unused Repentance boss called [[Cut Content#Raglich|Raglich]] would have spawned rag themed Creeps known as Rag Creeps which are also unused.
* {{dlc|r}} Soy Creeps and Tainted Soy Creeps' eyes glow bright white in dark rooms.

